// Rook's VFX (A6, 14 §4): crimson. Every blow of the maul comes down under a crimson smear and
// lands with a white-hot star and cracks in the ground (`attack.fire`, `r.fire`); Cleave sweeps
// a crimson ring and a shock out to the area's true radius; Second Wind pulses crimson-gold
// motes; Lunge lands in a column of crimson light; Shockwave rolls out as a crimson wave.
// Instances of the client's VFX kit (05 §5.1); hand-authored next to the export; validated by
// `mftr-tools pack validate`.
(
    effects: [
